## Copy to local.properties (gitignored) and adjust for your machine.
## Android Studio usually writes sdk.dir automatically.

# sdk.dir=/Users/YOU/Library/Android/sdk

## Optional build-time backend URL override (no trailing slash).
## Prefer Settings → Backend URL at runtime on a physical phone.
## Emulator runtime default (when this is unset): http://10.0.2.2:8000
## Physical device runtime default: empty — set LAN IP in the app Settings.
# KAI_API_BASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8000
